stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Connecting
    Connecting --> Live: socket open
    Connecting --> Refused: RESYNC_REQUIRED
    Live --> Offline: offline / socket error
    Offline --> Connecting: online, backoff
    Live --> Resynchronising: ack for an unseen op
    Resynchronising --> Live: state replaced
